# Accept unstable keywords for i486 builds
#
# i486 is not an officially supported Gentoo architecture,
# so we often need to accept ~x86 keywords

# Accept unstable for all our target packages
*/* ~x86

# monolith overlay packages — accept all keywords (local overlay, no arch support matrix)
sys-kernel/monolith-kernel **
games-roguelike/rl144 **
dev-db/monolith-sqlite **
dev-lang/monolith-perl **
app-misc/monolith-base **
x11-libs/libXfont **
x11-base/monolith-xserver **
www-client/stele **
